messages:
kevin_cs: Hey team - onboarding check: NovaArcade (Unity) seeing big bursts of 429s against /v1/preflight during scene loads and when players resume the app from background. Happening right after release to a small beta. Any quick guidance to keep them from burning through quota?

lia_sdk: can you paste a tiny log excerpt and the SDK version?

kevin_cs: logs: `POST /v1/preflight 429` x30 in ~45s, client ip consistent, UA: NovaUnity/1.2.0, tokens look ephemeral TTL 45s. They call SDK.Init() in Awake() for several scene prefabs.

unity-eng: that pattern will stampede. Multiple GameObjects calling Init on scene load + short ephemeral TTL = many concurrent preflight calls. Quick wins: 1) single app-level init (singleton GameObject with DontDestroyOnLoad), 2) local token cache with refresh jitter, 3) backoff on 429s.

kevin_cs: can you drop a small Unity snippet we can send them?

unity-eng: send this minimal example: 
```csharp
using UnityEngine;
public class RedwoodManager : MonoBehaviour {
  private static RedwoodManager _instance;
  void Awake() {
    if (_instance != null) { Destroy(gameObject); return; }
    _instance = this;
    DontDestroyOnLoad(gameObject);
    SDK.Init(); // single init for app lifetime
  }
}
// token cache sketch
private string cachedToken = null;
private float tokenExpiry = 0f;
string GetToken() {
  if (cachedToken == null || Time.realtimeSinceStartup > tokenExpiry - 10f) {
    // stagger fetch with random jitter to avoid thundering herd
    float jitter = Random.Range(0.0f, 0.5f);
    StartCoroutine(DelayedFetch(jitter));
  }
  return cachedToken;
}
```

lia_sdk: also recommend client-side exponential backoff on 429: base 150ms * 2^n + jitter up to 200ms, cap ~4s. And local circuit after 5 immediate 429s for 30s.

kevin_cs: nice. From server side, any short-term knobs before a deeper infra change?

tom_infra: we can enable tenant preflight coalescing (group similar init requests) and raise their burst window temporarily. I'll create a ticket to flip the flag and bump quota for the beta. Should smooth the next few hours.

ticket-bot: Ticket #91204 created: "tenant: novaarcade - preflight-coalesce + burst-bump" assigned eng-infra. ETA ~1.5h.

lia_sdk: for observability, ask them to add SDK debug headers to preflight (if possible) and capture `token_age_seconds` and concurrent connections count. That helps confirm token churn vs init fanout.

kevin_cs: sending the Unity snippet + backoff recommendations to NovaArcade now and telling them we requested the tenant flag. Will follow up after they patch. Thanks all. :rocket:
